    "name": "Realm Watch",
    "steam_appid": 1980300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/8ecc3ecb502b1a3f362e6bfda62896a6.poster.avif?t=1748773159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/8ecc3ecb502b1a3f362e6bfda62896a6.webm?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/8ecc3ecb502b1a3f362e6bfda62896a6.mp4?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome, chosen hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Realm Watch</i></strong> is a wild mix of <strong>wave defense</strong> and <strong>tower building</strong>, set in the dark world of Nebrumluminux. Choose your hero, invite your friends in <strong>4-player co-op</strong>, and face hordes of mutated, overwhelming enemies that will thrill every fantasy fan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one is safe from the <strong>falling shimmer</strong>\u2014and our roster of enemies will continue to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/3cc6a008c07061094423dc28dddff9e9.poster.avif?t=1748773159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/3cc6a008c07061094423dc28dddff9e9.webm?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/3cc6a008c07061094423dc28dddff9e9.mp4?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What has happened so far...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of <strong>Realm Watch</strong>, humans, orcs, dwarves, the Leifen Elves, and the Ztarben Elves are divided into four factions, each worshipping a great god in the battle for control of <strong>Nebrumluminux</strong>, a war that has raged since the dawn of recorded history. But on the fateful day of the <strong>Shimmerfall</strong>, the Four Great Gods\u2014<strong>Luxperan</strong>, <strong>Ascendios</strong>, and <strong>Umbraeth, Mistress of the Mists</strong>\u2014let out agonizing screams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Unite the world. Stop slaughtering each other. <strong>Ctzaarkhshe</strong> has arrived.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since that day, the gods have fallen silent, and the skies now rain literal pus, <strong>madness</strong>, and tentacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, you play as a hero, joining forces with others to seek and recover the gods' lost artifacts, hoping to restore their power... for they have remained silent since the <strong>Shimmerfall</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/55973b35bbcdfd776895c711ca5e3c32.poster.avif?t=1748773159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/55973b35bbcdfd776895c711ca5e3c32.webm?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/55973b35bbcdfd776895c711ca5e3c32.mp4?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are an ambitious four-person team with a passion for creating games <strong>by players, for players</strong>. From the start, our game will feature core mechanics\u2014you'll choose a hero, play with friends, build, and battle together. But this is just the beginning. We're already working on <strong>in-game art</strong>, a <strong>detailed lore-rich environment</strong>, and an immersive game world filled with monsters. We\u2019re also constantly working to improve the game\u2019s aesthetics to ensure a visually captivating experience. Plus, <strong>couch co-op for PC</strong> is on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our vision includes a massive story and campaign where players can dive deeper into the world of <strong>Realm Watch</strong>. We're exploring <strong>roguelite elements</strong> and, with enough time, we'll also incorporate <strong>RPG elements</strong>. Expect to see new levels, enemies, heroes, mini-bosses, and full bosses being added regularly, along with new defense systems. A <strong>skill tree</strong> is also on the way. Additionally, we are introducing in-game <strong>Grimoire</strong>, allowing players to collect and read information about the world, characters, and lore as they explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As players ourselves, this isn\u2019t just a project\u2014it's a <strong>passion</strong> and a <strong>promise</strong>. We're working hard to bring this vision to life, but with a small team, <strong>it takes time</strong>. That\u2019s why we value every piece of feedback and support from our community. We\u2019ll be closely working with you to make <strong>Realm Watch</strong> the best it can be. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/8ecc3ecb502b1a3f362e6bfda62896a6.poster.avif?t=1748773159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/8ecc3ecb502b1a3f362e6bfda62896a6.webm?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/8ecc3ecb502b1a3f362e6bfda62896a6.mp4?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome, chosen hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Realm Watch</i></strong> is a wild mix of <strong>wave defense</strong> and <strong>tower building</strong>, set in the dark world of Nebrumluminux. Choose your hero, invite your friends in <strong>4-player co-op</strong>, and face hordes of mutated, overwhelming enemies that will thrill every fantasy fan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one is safe from the <strong>falling shimmer</strong>\u2014and our roster of enemies will continue to grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/3cc6a008c07061094423dc28dddff9e9.poster.avif?t=1748773159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/3cc6a008c07061094423dc28dddff9e9.webm?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/3cc6a008c07061094423dc28dddff9e9.mp4?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What has happened so far...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the world of <strong>Realm Watch</strong>, humans, orcs, dwarves, the Leifen Elves, and the Ztarben Elves are divided into four factions, each worshipping a great god in the battle for control of <strong>Nebrumluminux</strong>, a war that has raged since the dawn of recorded history. But on the fateful day of the <strong>Shimmerfall</strong>, the Four Great Gods\u2014<strong>Luxperan</strong>, <strong>Ascendios</strong>, and <strong>Umbraeth, Mistress of the Mists</strong>\u2014let out agonizing screams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Unite the world. Stop slaughtering each other. <strong>Ctzaarkhshe</strong> has arrived.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since that day, the gods have fallen silent, and the skies now rain literal pus, <strong>madness</strong>, and tentacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now, you play as a hero, joining forces with others to seek and recover the gods' lost artifacts, hoping to restore their power... for they have remained silent since the <strong>Shimmerfall</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/55973b35bbcdfd776895c711ca5e3c32.poster.avif?t=1748773159\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/55973b35bbcdfd776895c711ca5e3c32.webm?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980300/extras/55973b35bbcdfd776895c711ca5e3c32.mp4?t=1748773159\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why Early Access?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are an ambitious four-person team with a passion for creating games <strong>by players, for players</strong>. From the start, our game will feature core mechanics\u2014you'll choose a hero, play with friends, build, and battle together. But this is just the beginning. We're already working on <strong>in-game art</strong>, a <strong>detailed lore-rich environment</strong>, and an immersive game world filled with monsters. We\u2019re also constantly working to improve the game\u2019s aesthetics to ensure a visually captivating experience. Plus, <strong>couch co-op for PC</strong> is on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our vision includes a massive story and campaign where players can dive deeper into the world of <strong>Realm Watch</strong>. We're exploring <strong>roguelite elements</strong> and, with enough time, we'll also incorporate <strong>RPG elements</strong>. Expect to see new levels, enemies, heroes, mini-bosses, and full bosses being added regularly, along with new defense systems. A <strong>skill tree</strong> is also on the way. Additionally, we are introducing in-game <strong>Grimoire</strong>, allowing players to collect and read information about the world, characters, and lore as they explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As players ourselves, this isn\u2019t just a project\u2014it's a <strong>passion</strong> and a <strong>promise</strong>. We're working hard to bring this vision to life, but with a small team, <strong>it takes time</strong>. That\u2019s why we value every piece of feedback and support from our community. We\u2019ll be closely working with you to make <strong>Realm Watch</strong> the best it can be. </p>",
    "short_description": "Realm Watch is a cooperative Top-Down Dark Fantasy defense game where you choose your hero, fortify your defenses, and battle to survive relentless enemy waves. The sky weeps glowing pus\u2014are you ready to defend the realm?",
